SET UTF-8
FLAG num
TRY abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
COMPOUNDMIN 2
ONLYINCOMPOUND 99
FULLSTRIP
NOSPLITSUGS
ONLYMAXDIFF
MAXNGRAMSUGS 2
COMPOUNDRULE 5
COMPOUNDRULE 1*2?3
COMPOUNDRULE (4)(5)
COMPOUNDRULE (6)?(7)*
COMPOUNDRULE (1)*(2)?(3)
COMPOUNDRULE (4)*(5)?(6)
REP 2
REP a e
REP y ie
PFX 10 Y 1
PFX 10 0 re .
PFX 11 N 1
PFX 11 0 pre .
SFX 20 Y 2
SFX 20 0 s [^s]
SFX 20 0 es s
SFX 21 Y 1
SFX 21 y ied y
SFX 22 N 1
SFX 22 0 er .
